\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHARejoin.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyUnfencedRewinds = FALSE
    BuggyExpiredWalRewinds = FALSE
    BuggyForcedRewinds = FALSE
    BuggyIdentityMismatchRewinds = FALSE
    BuggyStaleAssessmentTruncates = FALSE
    BuggyForkMismatchTruncates = FALSE

INVARIANT Safety

PROPERTIES
    EventuallyAssessed
    RejoinEventuallyExecutes

==== BadExpiredWalRewind
SPECIFICATION Spec
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.
\* AssessmentMatchesPolicy is intentionally coupled (the mutant corrupts the chosen action).

CONSTANTS
    BuggyUnfencedRewinds = FALSE
    BuggyExpiredWalRewinds = TRUE
    BuggyForcedRewinds = FALSE
    BuggyIdentityMismatchRewinds = FALSE
    BuggyStaleAssessmentTruncates = FALSE
    BuggyForkMismatchTruncates = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    RewindRequiresCompatibleFence

